spec PushAudit.tla
check INVARIANTS UpdateSuccessAfterSave UpdateAssociation DeliveryAssociation DeliveryClassification DeliveryRecordedBeforeSave
reach Replaced | two generations
reach CanceledSecond | two generations
reach UpdateWriteFailed | two generations
reach DeliveryWriteFailed | two generations
reach Expired | two generations
reach Retry | two generations
run two generations | Limit=2
